%h2.mca_help_markup_heading Markdown
%p.mca_help_markup_aside
  For a more complete guide on Markdown, see <a href="https://commonmark.org/help/" target="_blank">https://commonmark.org/help/</a>
%table.mca_help_markup_demo
  %tr
    %th.mca_help_markup_demo_heading.color_bg_heading text data
    %th.mca_help_markup_demo_heading.color_bg_heading markdown result
  - markup_examples.each do |markup_example|
    %tr.mca_help_markup_demo_example
      %td.mca_help_markup_demo_example_input
        = simple_format(markup_example)
      %td.mca_help_markup_demo_example_output
        = parser.parse_and_sanitize(markup_example)
